cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Single-cell QC
abstract: Per-sample quality control of single-cell and single-nucleus RNA-seq (10x 3'/5', Flex, Multiome
  RNA). Removes ambient RNA with CellBender when the raw droplet matrix is available, flags outlier cells by
  median absolute deviations and a mitochondrial cap, detects doublets with Scrublet, removes the flagged
  cells and log-normalizes, with per-cell tables and figures.
